  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2021, Aqua for All joined the Steering Committee of the Toilet Board Coalition after many years of partnership and closely aligned work. The TBC is enabling private sector engagement; connecting large and small companies; and ensuring close collaboration between private, public and non-profit sectors with the common goal to achieve Sustainable Development Goal 6 (SDG6), universal access to sanitation.</narrative>
